      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 720,
        "content": "## Find TikTok creators with emails by keyword and save leads to Google Sheets\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow is manually started, then applies configured search criteria to find TikTok creators via an Apify TikTok profile scraper. It extracts the desired lead fields, including email-related columns, and appends the cleaned lead data to Google Sheets.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Configure the Search settings node with the target keywords, follower range, and maximum result count.\n- Add the required Apify API token or HTTP authentication details in the TikTok scraper request node.\n- Configure the Google Sheets credential and select the target spreadsheet and sheet for saving leads.\n- Verify that the code node outputs columns matching the headers expected in Google Sheets.\n\n### Customization\n\nAdjust the keywords, follower thresholds, maxResults value, or code-node field mapping to change what creators are collected and which lead columns are saved."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "b248a526-0803-44e8-8446-94a486a6da47",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -128,
        -64
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 416,
        "height": 320,
        "content": "## Start and search criteria\n\nManual trigger and search configuration that define the TikTok creator discovery parameters before the scraping request runs."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "0b6a7c92-e790-46d5-856b-9e2c8b5ca7d7",
